WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.101 --> 00:00:08.372
In this video you’ll sign in to Bergeron Maps and open your site.

2
00:00:08.372 --> 00:00:12.446
It takes about two minutes, and there’s no password to set up.

3
00:00:12.896 --> 00:00:22.276
Go to bergeronmaps.com and choose Sign in, at the top of the page.

4
00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:27.071
Type your work email, the one your account was set up with.

5
00:00:27.071 --> 00:00:29.721
Then choose Email me a sign-in link.

6
00:00:30.176 --> 00:00:35.353
We send you an email with a sign-in link and a six-digit code.

7
00:00:35.353 --> 00:00:39.696
Open the link on this device, or type the code here.

8
00:00:39.696 --> 00:00:41.533
Both work for an hour.

9
00:00:41.984 --> 00:00:44.264
Choose Sign in.

10
00:00:44.717 --> 00:00:47.509
You’re in. This is the Maps page.

11
00:00:47.509 --> 00:00:50.555
It lists every site in your company.

12
00:00:51.007 --> 00:00:55.101
Here’s our example site, Sample Garage.

13
00:00:55.101 --> 00:01:03.813
Each site has five slots for maps, and the line next to its name shows how many are

14
00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:05.807
used and published.

15
00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:11.693
If you manage just one site, you’ll see only that site here.

16
00:01:12.147 --> 00:01:14.278
Sample Garage has no maps yet.

17
00:01:14.278 --> 00:01:17.191
Building the first one is the next video.

18
00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.728
You stay signed in on this device.

19
00:01:19.728 --> 00:01:23.652
If you’re ever signed out, just ask for a new link the same way.
